      "id": "inugami-curse-s13-p0582",
      "source_en": "The chief and his troop climbed up the narrow staircase leading to the observation deck. Kindaichi and Furudate followed, but as soon as they reached the top of the stairs, Kindaichi's eyes widened at what he saw. There was a round wicker tea table surrounded by five or six matching chairs, one of which lay overturned. A huge pool of blood covered a part of the floor.",
